flowchart TD
  B[ESP32-S3 boots] --> U[Read immutable hardware UID + persisted device key]
  U --> C[POST /api/nodes/contact]
  C --> R{Registered?}
  R -->|no| P[Pending node in FarmPi]
  P --> A[Android Nodes admin approves + assigns identity/location]
  A --> E[Initial desired config: all modes OFF]
  R -->|yes| H{Applied fingerprint matches desired?}
  E --> H
  H -->|yes| S[IN SYNC]
  H -->|no| F[POST /api/nodes/configuration]
  F --> V[Validate schema, node identity, capabilities, canonical bytes + SHA-256]
  V -->|valid| N[Write inactive NVS slot + read back]
  N --> X[Switch active config and apply]
  X --> K[POST /api/nodes/ack]
  K --> S
  V -->|invalid / persistence failure| L[Keep last known-good config]
  L --> Q[Report failure for attempted fingerprint]
  Q --> D[UPDATE FAILED for current desired state]
  S --> T[Generate SIMULATED or acquire advertised LIVE measurements]
  T --> I[Authenticated sparse ingest with source/location/time/provenance]
  CLI[Pi console configure-node-modes] --> H
  S --> UI[Android displays modes read-only]
